> Quoting  Ralf Damaschke  <rwspam@gmx.de>:
>> And the priest in the
>>valley is not aligned (not that it matters).
> 
> No. The altar in the Valley is of the kind commonly referred to as
> "unaligned", but there are only two kinds of temple priest in NetHack:
> 
>         priest = makemon(&mons[sanctum ? PM_HIGH_PRIEST :
>         PM_ALIGNED_PRIEST], 
>                          sx + 1, sy, NO_MM_FLAGS);
> 
> This isn't a PM_HIGH_PRIEST, it's a PM_ALIGNED_PRIEST.

Well, at least this solves the puzzle for me that the corpse is always
that of an aligned priest (I never felt the need to apply a stethoscope
to Moloch's priest).

